<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{$decor_tittle}</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-dark: #0f172a;
            --bg-card: #1e293b;
            --text-main: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --accent: #10b981;
            --accent-glow: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
        }
        
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text-main);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            background-image: radial-gradient(circle at top right, var(--accent-glow), transparent 40%);
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .logo-area { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
        
        h1 {
            font-size: 4rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #ffffff, #94a3b8);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .version {
            font-size: 1rem;
            background: var(--accent);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            vertical-align: middle;
            margin-left: 10px;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: #fff;
        }

        .tagline {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        /* Grid 4 Pilar Filosofi */
        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: var(--accent);
        }

        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .feature-title {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .feature-desc {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        footer {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            padding-top: 2rem;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .heart { color: #ef4444; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="logo-area">
            <h1>DECOR <span class="version">{$decor_version}</span></h1>
            <p class="tagline">{$decor_massage}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="features-grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
                <div class="feature-title">Lightweight</div>
                <div class="feature-desc">Zero unnecessary dependencies. Built for lightning-fast execution and RAM efficiency.</div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🛡️</div>
                <div class="feature-title">Secure</div>
                <div class="feature-desc">Latte Engine's built-in intelligent XSS protection and Medoo's anti-SQL injection.</div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🚀</div>
                <div class="feature-title">Powerful</div>
                <div class="feature-desc">A pure MVC structure combined with Bramus Router, ready for enterprise-scale applications.</div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🔓</div>
                <div class="feature-title">Open Source</div>
                <div class="feature-desc">The code is entirely yours. It is free to use for both personal and commercial applications.</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer>
            Designed with <span class="heart">❤</span> by DeiraInsight from Timor-Leste people.<br>
            <small>Edit <code>app/Controllers</code> to start building your application.</small>
        </footer>
    </div>

</body>
</html>